    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "James L. Murtagh Auctioneers are delighted to present Shantobar, Ballinalee, an exclusive and stylish new development of 8 semi-detached homes, situated at a most desirable residential location in Ballinalee, Co. Longford. These newly developed properties, backed by a 10-year Homebond warranty, complement the existing properties within the development which has been taken in charge by the local authority.\r\nDesigned with the contemporary homeowner in mind, these A2-rated energy-efficient homes combine cutting-edge architecture with sustainable living and exceptional build quality. Each property features advanced air-to-water heat pump systems, zoned heating, and superior insulation and airtightness for optimal comfort and efficiency. \r\nShantobar presents an exclusive collection of beautifully designed semi-detached houses, thoughtfully crafted to offer the perfect balance of style, practicality, and modern convenience. Extending to approximately 101 sq.m. (1,085 sq.ft.) over two floors, these homes provide bright, spacious, and well-proportioned accommodation throughout.\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway leading to a bright and inviting living room filled with natural light. To the rear, a spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area features a bespoke contemporary fitted kitchen with an excellent range of cabinetry and storage solutions. A separate utility room, complete with matching units and dedicated appliance space, further enhances practicality. Access to the rear garden is available from both the kitchen via patio doors and the utility room. A guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation.\r\nUpstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms, including a superb principal bedroom with a stylish en-suite bathroom featuring an electric shower. A well-appointed family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms and completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nAccommodation: \r\nSitting room 3.42m x 4.34m\r\nKitchen/ Dining area 4.39m x 3.37m\r\nUtility 1.62m x 3.37m\r\nBathroom 1.3m x 1.83m\r\nMaster Bedroom 1 3.77m x 3.15m (en-suite 2.57m x 0.94m)\r\nBedroom 2 2.9m x 2.45m\r\nBedroom 3 3.12m x 3.55m\r\nBathroom 2.24m x 1.7m\r\n\r\nCombining elegant design, energy efficiency, and exceptional attention to detail, these homes offer an outstanding opportunity for purchasers seeking a high-quality home in a desirable setting.\r\nIn addition, purchasers will benefit from generous allowances towards kitchen finishes and flooring, providing the opportunity to personalise their new home to suit individual tastes and requirements.\r\nThe development is approved for the Government's Help to Buy Scheme, offering eligible first-time buyers valuable financial support when purchasing their home. Combined with other homeownership initiatives and funding options that may be available, these incentives can make the path to homeownership more accessible and affordable.\r\n\r\nThis development will meet a wide range of needs and lifestyles, whether one is beginning the homeownership path or seeking to downsize.  Conveniently located on the commuter belt, the properties are well-connected by road and rail, making travel to Dublin and other parts of Ireland easy. The train and bus stations in Longford and Edgeworthstown (both a 15 minute drive away) offer frequent services to Dublin, while major roadways ensure easy access to surrounding areas. \r\n\r\nNestled in the peaceful Longford countryside, Shantobar enjoys a tranquil rural setting in the heart of the picturesque village of Ballinalee, Co. Longford. This charming location offers the perfect balance between country living and convenience, with a host of local amenities within a 5 minute walk, including schools, shops, and pubs all within easy reach.\r\n\r\n•\tNational School connected to Shantobar by continuous footpath \r\n•\tLocal childcare facilities including afterschool services\r\n•\tBuses to secondary schools in Granard and Longford\r\n•\tLocal shops for day to day requirements including filling station\r\n•\tPost office\r\n•\tSeveral pubs\r\n•\tButchers\r\n•\tCafe/restaurant and local history museum\r\n•\tMedical centre\r\n•\tAgricultural and country supplies store\r\n•\tLocal GAA club (Sean Connollys) and pitch & putt course\r\n•\tVillage playground (currently being significantly expanded)\r\n•\tForest walkway linking the school to the GAA club grounds\r\n•\tFrequent bus services to both Longford and Granard (including late evening rural link service)\r\n\r\nBallinalee is a vibrant and welcoming community steeped in history and character, known for its strong cultural heritage and scenic surroundings. The area is well-connected, with Longford Town just a 15-minute drive away, offering a wider range of services, including supermarkets, secondary schools, restaurants, and a train station with regular services to Dublin and Sligo.\r\n\r\nThe nearby countryside offers beautiful walking routes, fishing spots, and outdoor recreational opportunities, making it an ideal location for nature lovers and those seeking a quieter pace of life. Whether you're looking for a peaceful retreat or a family home with room to grow, Shantobar offers a rare opportunity to enjoy the charm of rural Ireland while staying connected to key transport links and urban amenities.\r\n\r\nFor more information and to register your interest, please contact James L. Murtagh Auctioneers at info@jlm.ie or (044) 93 40088\r\nDisclaimer: These particulars are issued by the selling agent on behalf of the developer for the purpose of identification only and do not constitute any part of an offer or contract. All descriptions, dimensions, plans, specifications, finishes and particulars are provided in good faith and are believed to be correct at the time of publication but may be subject to change. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A2 BER Energy Rating – Highly energy-efficient homes with lower running costs and future-proof sustainability. \r\nExclusive Development of Just 8 Homes – Small, private development offering greater exclusivity and community feel.  \r\nAir-to-Water Heat Pump Heating System – Modern, eco-friendly heating with excellent energy performance. \r\nSpacious 3-Bedroom Family Homes 101 sq.m.– Well-designed layouts with generous living accommodation over two floors. \r\nContemporary Open-Plan Kitchen & Dining Area – Bright, modern living space with patio doors to the rear garden. \r\nHigh-Quality Build Specification – Superior insulation, airtightness, zoned heating, and excellent attention to detail throughout. \r\nPersonalisation Options Available – Generous allowances towards kitchen finishes and flooring, allowing buyers to customise their home. \r\nEligible for the Help to Buy Scheme – Significant financial support available for qualifying first-time buyers. \r\nPeaceful Village Setting with Excellent Connectivity – Located in Ballinalee, just 15 minutes from Longford, with convenient access to Dublin via road and rail while enjoying a tranquil countryside lifestyle."
      },
